      "day": 33,
      "line": "🌒 Dusk. They come out of the treeline in a knot — 1 of them, thin and road-worn — and stop at the edge of your firelight like they're not sure they're allowed closer. The oldest steps forward. \"Felix Ibrahim. From Emberhold.\" A pause. \"We're asking for a fire.\""
